      // species art existed to route them to. Wave 4 authors dedicated
      // overworld spirit sprites (npc-cubonespirit-idle-1/2 and
      // npc-marowakspirit-idle-1/2, 16x20, ghostly pale palettes), so
      // both instances now carry explicit art fields pointing at them;
