        "shirt": "#3a6ac0",
        "pants": "#2a3a4a",
        "hair": "#1a1a1a",
        "dialogue": [
          "The lake north of here has moods. Lately it has a temper and a colour to match.",
          "Old folks say a red scale washed up once, years back. The lake keeps its secrets badly."
        ]
