        "pants": "#2a3a4a",
        "hair": "#1a1a1a",
        "dialogue": [
          "Pilgrims have swept this chamber for three hundred years. I am the current broom.",
          "The shrine's king was met on a far island, in storm-light, by a trainer the songs argue about. One king, one meeting. The sea does not repeat itself."
        ]
