// ---- Vermilion dock: the Johto crossing captain (Stage J3b) ----
// Rides on MAPS5's Vermilion (which already carries CAPT ORANGE for
// the Orange crossing), adding ONE npc: the Olivine ferryman, a
// ferryArc 'johto' network port exactly like CAPT ORANGE. Before
// Johto is reached he gates (arcFerryAllowed); once Johto has been
// reached (reachedarc_johto / reached_newbark) the crossing runs
// both ways unconditionally — Olivine's CAPT EASTWIND is his mirror.
// He stands at (11,10), between SAILOR BRINE and CAPT ORANGE on the
// south dock street, on open town ground (seals nothing).
MAPS6.vermilion = {
  ...MAPS5.vermilion,
  npcs: [
    ...MAPS5.vermilion.npcs,
    { x: 11, y: 10, name: 'CAPT EASTBOUND', art: 'sailor', skin: '#e8b888', shirt: '#2a7a6a', pants: '#2a2a3a', hair: '#5a3a2a',
      ferry: 'olivine', ferryArc: 'johto',
      dialogue: ['The Olivine run is the eastern crossing — Johto water, temple bells to salt spray in a single tide.',
                 "That crossing opens from home, trainer — Professor Hawthorn's office books it. Once Johto knows your face, we sail both ways, free, forever."] },
  ],
};


