// maps8.mjs — Arc 3.5 Stage F1: BATTLE FRONTIER (hub + facility
// maps). 11 maps: the frontierhub island (dock + shared Center/Mart
// doors + seven facility buildings), the seven facility interiors,
// and the Pyramid's three dark maze floors. Generated by
// ~/workspace/ashs-journey-qa/frontier-f1/gen_maps8.py (deterministic;
// edit the generator, not this file).
// Travel law: CAPT FRONTIER (Pallet, TALE_NPCS) sails to the hub's
// dock start; CAPT BREAKWATER on the pier sails back (ferryArc
// 'frontier' — the return is unconditional once reached, the
// NO-SOFT-LOCK LAW). The hub Center/Mart doors ride the shared
// 'center'/'mart' interiors WITH via (decision #9), so lastCenter
// lineage works on the island; facility doors follow the gym idiom
// (interior exits name the hub front tile directly).
// Pike geometry (F2-consumable): ONE map — entrance hall (south) +
// seven chambers + the Brain dais chamber (north). Each chamber's
// three north-wall doors ALL warp to the next chamber's entry row
// at spread landings x=3/7/11 (the door CHOICE is geometric; F2's
// engine assigns the events). Chambers are one-way: no warp leads
// back; the only exit is the dais chamber's north doors, which warp
// to the entrance hall. The Pyramid floors cycle a->b->c->a by
// exit warps (F2 counts transitions to know the floor number).
