//    until the species is CAUGHT. Arc completion = the catch.
//  - Levels sit in Johto's band (101-200): the beasts at 178/180/184,
//    Celebi 170, Ho-Oh 182 (in LEGENDARY_ARCS; ruling 3 supersedes
//    the designed Lv 70).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
